{"id":"n82239-4-6","stage":4,"title":"툭 · 突然绊到脚或被踢到的声音","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82239-4-6-1","ko":"봤어? 내가 골을 넣었어!","zh":"看到了吗？我进球了哦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"골을","meaning":"球，进球","explanation":"골：球，进球；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"골","audio":"/audio/68a6cf8ed8e09fd6ad87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27718","senseId":"2","lemma":"골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"골을","audio":"/audio/0ba65cbd960bebf1dbc8.mp3"}},{"text":"넣었어!","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣었어","audio":"/audio/4a848d95d77e3ab3743b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"68a6cf8ed8e09fd6","term":"골","zh":"球，进球","audio":"/audio/68a6cf8ed8e09fd6ad87.mp3","entryId":"27718","definition":"足球、篮球、曲棍球、手球等运动中射门得分。又指成功射入的球。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b57635043535a66f478c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82239-4-6-2","ko":"공을 툭 차기만 했는데도 들어가다니. 그냥 운이 좋았지 뭐.","zh":"只是轻轻一踢球，它居然就进去了。不过是运气好罢了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공을","meaning":"球","explanation":"공：球；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19496","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공을","audio":"/audio/9d758f4340bdff23ef7e.mp3"}},{"text":"툭","meaning":"突然绊到脚或被踢到的声音；或指其模样。","explanation":"툭：突然绊到脚或被踢到的声音；或指其模样。","readings":[{"term":"툭","audio":"/audio/68b8683a32aec4245805.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82239","senseId":"4","lemma":"툭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"툭","audio":"/audio/68b8683a32aec4245805.mp3"}},{"text":"차기만","meaning":"只是踢了一下","explanation":"차다：踢；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71365","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차기만","audio":"/audio/6d136fff416693e4ca56.mp3"}},{"text":"했는데도","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했는데도","audio":"/audio/1618540de8b49384be72.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가다니.","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；다니：对听到的内容表示惊讶、感叹或反问。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가다니","audio":"/au